    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExcess 375,000\n\nSherry FitzGerald Radford are delighted to bring to the market this wonderfully located detached three bedroom property that has been upgraded and enhanced by the current owners to provide a home of distinction.\nSet behind electric gates, the property has been upgraded and enhanced to included newly fitted triple glazed \"Munster Joinery\" windows throughout, newly fitted boiler, newly fitted kitchen, newly fitted stoves in both the living room and the kitchen and an upgraded ensuite.\nThe accommodation comprises entrance hall, living room, open plan kitchen / dining area /sunroom, utility room, 3 bedrooms, master ensuite and a family bathroom. \nOutside is bordered with mature hedging allowing for complete seclusion and there is a large shed to the side offering ample storage. A sunny South-facing patio area to the rear ensures plenty of sun and light all year round. There is ample off-street parking surrounding the property.\nThe location is second to none being within moments of the Newline road giving easy access to Wellingtonbrige, Wexford and some of Irelands most amazing coastline."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.64m x 2.14m plus 5.19m x 0.97m\nL shpaped hall with tiled floor and shelved hotpress ideal for storage (1.47m x 0.76m)\n\nLiving Room - 4.55m x 4.15m\nBow shaped window (2.35m x 0.71m) feature fireplace with inset wood burning stove, quartz hearth and cast iron inset, wooden flooring.\n\nOpen plan kitchen / dining area - 5.84m x 3.28m\nDual aspect room overlooking the rear garden, fitted wall and floor units, fitted display units, granite worktop with integrated sink and drain, granite upstand, built in hob with extractor, built in double oven, under unit lighting, recessed lighting, ceiling coving, opening into\n\nSunroom - 4.51m x 4.49m\nStunning sunroom featuring a triple aspect with double patio doors to rear, extra high ceiling with recessed lighting, ceiling fan light, stand alone \"Henley\" wood burning stove with granite base, wooden flooring.\n\nUtility Room - 3.66m x 1.83m\nFitted wall and floor units, plumbed for dishwasher plumbed for washing machine, tiled floor, hatch to attic, door to rear.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.78m x 3.04m\nPicture window to front, laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.78m x 3.59m\nPicture window to front, laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.88m x 3.71m\nPicture window to rear, laminate flooring.\n\nEnsuite - 3.32m x 0.99m\nNewly fitted suite comprising fully tilled shower with \"Mira Elite\" shower, wc, wash hand basin with storage, tiled floor, tiled splashback.\n\nBathroom - 3.33m x 1.75m\nSuite comprising bath, wc, wash hand basin with storage, step in fully tiled shower with \"Redring Expressions S20Ts\" shower, part tiled walls, tiled floor.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nLarge container - 9.07m x 3.83m\nIdeal storage space\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Beautifully upgraded detached 3 bedroom bungalow in countryside location</li><li>Triple glazed Munster Joinery windows</li><li>Newly fitted kitchen with top of the range appliances</li><li>Stunning sunroom to rear</li><li>Ample off street parking</li><li>Landscaped gardens surrounding the property</li><li>Newly fitted oil boiler</li><li>Newly fitted stoves in kiitchen and living room</ul>"
      },
